<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Seeff half-yr shr up, no div.</title>
<headline>Seeff half-yr shr up, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended August 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     9.2	   vs  8.8</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   4.54	  vs  3.53</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   5.93	  vs  5.09</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.38	  vs  1.46</p>
<p>    Turnover		 61.78	  vs 60.32</p>
<p>Full name: Seeff Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said a final dividend would be declared for the year ending February 28. The company said that if current market conditions persisted a more modest rate of earnings growth is anticipated for the full year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
